flowchart LR
    U[Customer/User]
    PG[Payment Gateway]

    P51((5.1 Validate Cart))
    P52((5.2 Validate Address))
    P53((5.3 Authorize Payment))
    P54((5.4 Create Order))
    P55((5.5 Finalize Checkout))

    D3[(D3 Cart and Cart Items)]
    D5[(D5 Orders and Order Items)]
    D6[(D6 User Addresses)]

    U -->|checkout request| P51
    P51 -->|read items and totals| D3
    P51 -->|valid cart| P52

    U -->|selected address| P52
    P52 -->|read address| D6
    P52 -->|validated address| P53

    U -->|payment info| P53
    P53 -->|authorization request| PG
    PG -->|authorization result| P53
    P53 -->|payment approved| P54

    P54 -->|create order and lines| D5
    P54 -->|order created| P55

    P55 -->|clear purchased cart items| D3
    P55 -->|confirmation and order id| U